              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.20.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk. 20.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Babaandu babili wandaaye ne wandaaye ne bamenya alala, mala mulala khu nibo afwe ne akhasaala omwana omusoleeli tawe, nono namulekhwa wewe se alateekha khu mundu okundi busa okhali owe nju eyo tawe. Mulamue akhoya abukule namulekhwa oyo nga omukhasi wewe mala akhole kimilimo kia wandaaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwana owe sisoleeli omubele niye balasaala alatiuukhwa lisina lia raraawe owafwa, nio lisaaye liewe lichiililile mu Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "RUT.4.7+RUT.4.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ru. 4.7-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ne wandaaye woyo owafwa ne akhenya khukobosia mulamue tawe, namulekhwa oyo alacha khu bemeelesi be lukoba asilibwa mala alome ali, ‘Mulamwa se eenya lisina lia wandaaye lichiililile mu Isiraeli tawe. Se eenya khukholela ese kimilimo nikio wandaaye aakholanga tawe.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babemeelesi be lukoba balalaanga omundu oyo mala balomalome naye. Aaba ne asiloba khukobosia namulekhwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "namulekhwa oyo alamuchaakho ebweeni we babemeelesi be lukoba, amufuule siraaro silala, amufuuche mu moni mala alome ali, ‘Kano niko kakekholekha khu mundu okhenya lisaaye lia wandaaye lichiililile tawe.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enju yewe elamanyikha mu Isiraeli nga, ‘Enju yo mundu owafuulwa siraaro.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
